%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a4fafe43b89343e3a7ba1235e8987c0f, type: 3}
  m_Name: WasteInfectionSymptoms
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  Entries:
  - content: ...How bad is it?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5e611c80cca3abf42b4a5c1a2294b953, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: "It\u2019s not terminal."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 76d5a271a719e8f4cad7429ce9e05c1c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 1014197516907839559
  - content: "But the Waste has a side effect that will disrupt your body\u2019s
      natural communication systems. "
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 76d5a271a719e8f4cad7429ce9e05c1c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: 'It increases your body''s natural <i>Frequency</i> which can cause
      your body to shift out of phase.

'
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 76d5a271a719e8f4cad7429ce9e05c1c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 1014197516907839560
  - content: "Naturally, this makes utilizing the existing energy in your system
      much less efficient. \r\n"
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 76d5a271a719e8f4cad7429ce9e05c1c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: 'So while we can manage the symptoms with suppressants and Amplitude
      infusions, you will still grow weaker.

'
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 76d5a271a719e8f4cad7429ce9e05c1c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: Any significant physical exertion, especially in the field, will increase
      the amount of energy your body produces.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 76d5a271a719e8f4cad7429ce9e05c1c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: And will drastically accelerate the Waste's spread.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 76d5a271a719e8f4cad7429ce9e05c1c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: ...
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5e611c80cca3abf42b4a5c1a2294b953, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: 'I made a promise. '
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5e611c80cca3abf42b4a5c1a2294b953, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 1014197516907839569
  - content: To be out there with all that I am, and all that I will be.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5e611c80cca3abf42b4a5c1a2294b953, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 1014197516907839569
  - content: And I intend to keep it.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5e611c80cca3abf42b4a5c1a2294b953, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 1014197516907839569
  - content: "Ives, you can\u2019t\u2014 "
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 275918e912c757f4ab1b228eefee6401, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 1014197516907839561
    - rid: 1014197516907839562
  - content: "Put me on the next re-supply transport. That\u2019s an order, Doctor."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5e611c80cca3abf42b4a5c1a2294b953, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: "Commander, I\u2019d implore you to reconsider... Is this really something
      as important as your\u2014 "
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 76d5a271a719e8f4cad7429ce9e05c1c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 8634271983927558206
  - content: "That\u2019s an order, Doctor."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5e611c80cca3abf42b4a5c1a2294b953, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: ...
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 76d5a271a719e8f4cad7429ce9e05c1c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: As you wish, Commander. I will prepare a regimen of our strongest suppressants.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 76d5a271a719e8f4cad7429ce9e05c1c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 1014197516907839563
  - content: "Reichel? A word in my lab, when you\u2019re ready."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 76d5a271a719e8f4cad7429ce9e05c1c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
